@group client
@commands Full pack client: apply a capped effect at level III (`/effect give @s <capped effect> 60 2`), look at the HUD, the inventory effect list, a potion item or wine tooltip and the JEI page
@pass the effect shows level I (no level numeral) in every place; an uncapped effect keeps its level
@fails `[effects] levelCaps` (getAmplifier, tooltip mixins); one display path not capped
@reviewed 2026-11-24
