## SQ-CC13-07 | Common alone: vanilla defaults (recipe unlocks on, no effect swaps, empty removed list, no composters)
@group B (Common only)
@commands `cc_only alone`, fresh config; `/recipe give @s minecraft:stick`; read the written `config/creativecommon-common.toml`; grep latest.log for `[jeiRemove]` and `[itemMerges]`; `/give @s creativecommon:spruce_composter`
@pass the recipe is given (`Unlocked 1 recipes`); the toml has `[recipe_book] unlocks = true`, `remap = []`, `categoryOverrides = []` and no `[bees]` or `[wandering_trader]`; no `[jeiRemove]` pack line; `creativecommon:spruce_composter` is an unknown item (the composters, `[bees]` and `[wandering_trader]` left Common in the wave 2 carve, 2026-11-24; Delight's composters: SQ-CM-43)
@fails `CommonConfig` defaults; `NoRecipeUnlockMixin` gate; a composter or `[bees]` / `[wandering_trader]` left in Common
@reviewed 2026-11-26
@modset cc_only alone
# written 2026-11-26 (r1126q writer-5): cc_only alone has the perfBot dev jar only (qmodset dev_keep), so the bot gives the recipe
> pbot spawn cc7 0 -60 0 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> recipe give cc7 minecraft:stick
waitlog Unlocked 1 recipes? for 20
shell grep -qE "^\s*unlocks = true" config/creativecommon-common.toml
shell grep -qE "^\s*remap = \[\]" config/creativecommon-common.toml
shell grep -qE "^\s*categoryOverrides = \[\]" config/creativecommon-common.toml
